Cell["\<\
The segment between two vertices of a grid, two steps apart in each \
direction: six geodesics, filling the rectangle they span. An edge is drawn \
as strongly as the number of geodesics through it.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"1f8555eb-6609-4a9e-8b99-b4c0ac0cdbb9"],

